-- חוזר לבעלויות תשפ"ו/8 (16.7.2026): קצובת ביגוד
-- The clothing allowance for school year תשפ"ו, the additional allowances
-- for physical-education teachers, for technological education and for
-- physiotherapists in Ofek Hadash or Oz LaTmura.

IMPORT prelude
IMPORT common
IMPORT vocabulary
IMPORT property_checks
IMPORT `clothing-recuperation-circulars-2-common`
IMPORT `clothing-recuperation-circulars-common`

-- Time in the regulative rules is counted in school months of תשפ"ו
-- (common.l4: September 2025 = 1, July 2026 = 11, August 2026 = 12).

-- not weighed against `the Hours of Work and Rest Law`: the clothing
-- allowance is paid pro rata to the position, up to one full position, and
-- the cap of 140% of a position across all employers restates the
-- agreements' limit on employment beyond a full position. A cap takes away
-- no rest and adds no hour; the weeks the agreements allow beyond a full
-- position are weighed where they set them (the takanon's §1.24, the base
-- agreement's §33, the Oz agreement's §14).

-- not weighed against `the Equal Pay Law`: the words the search found are
-- not on its subject: ‘בעל’ is holding or having (‘בעל תעודה’), not a
-- husband; ‘אב’ is the month of Av in a date; none gives pay or other
-- remuneration by sex.

§ `תשפ"ו/8 קצובת ביגוד`

-- akn:preamble The letterhead, date (16.7.2026), reference number, addressee and the subject line with its four topics; no rule.

DECLARE `tashpo-8 clothing action` IS ONE OF
    `pay the clothing allowance in circular תשפ"ו/8` HAS `clothing amount paid` IS A NUMBER
    `pay the physical-education allowance in circular תשפ"ו/8` HAS `physical-education amount paid` IS A NUMBER
    `pay the technological-education allowance in circular תשפ"ו/8` HAS `technological amount paid` IS A NUMBER
    `pay the physiotherapists' allowance in circular תשפ"ו/8` HAS `physiotherapy amount paid` IS A NUMBER
    `employ beyond the limits in circular תשפ"ו/8` HAS `position employed` IS A NUMBER

§§ `1 קצובת ביגוד לשנת הלימודים תשפ"ו`

-- akn:art_1/p1 The heading "תחולה"; no rule.
-- akn:art_1/p4 The heading "כללי"; no rule.

-- Section 1 applies to every employee graded on the teaching-staff scale
-- employed by an owning body the Ministry supervises; the Treasury's
-- instructions on the clothing allowance are followed as below.
@ref akn:art_1/p2 akn:art_1/p3
GIVEN `graded as teaching staff` IS A BOOLEAN, `employed by a supervised owning body` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `section 1 of circular תשפ"ו/8 applies to` `graded as teaching staff` `employed by a supervised owning body` IF
    `graded as teaching staff` AND `employed by a supervised owning body`

-- 1.ב: a teaching employee is entitled to the clothing allowance as it is
-- given to public-facing employees of the civil service, for school year
-- תשפ"ו (09/25–08/26).
@ref akn:art_1__para_b
GIVEN `graded as teaching staff` IS A BOOLEAN, `employed by a supervised owning body` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `is entitled to the public-facing clothing allowance for school year תשפ"ו` `graded as teaching staff` `employed by a supervised owning body` IF
    `section 1 of circular תשפ"ו/8 applies to` `graded as teaching staff` `employed by a supervised owning body`

-- 1.ג: the payment is at level 4, that is 2,527.
@ref akn:art_1__para_c
`the clothing allowance at level 4 of circular תשפ"ו/8` MEANS 2527

-- 1.ד: in proportion to the position, one full position at most; 1.ה: with
-- more than one employer, each pays on the position held with it, even
-- where the total passes 100%.
@ref akn:art_1__para_d akn:art_1__para_e
GIVEN `position fraction with this employer` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `clothing allowance of circular תשפ"ו/8` `position fraction with this employer` IS
    `the clothing allowance at level 4 of circular תשפ"ו/8` TIMES min `position fraction with this employer` 1

@ref akn:art_1__para_a
GIVEN `position fraction with this employer` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A DEONTIC Party `tashpo-8 clothing action`
DECIDE `clothing allowance paid in full with July's salary of circular תשפ"ו/8` `position fraction with this employer` IS
    PARTY `the employer`
    MUST  `pay the clothing allowance in circular תשפ"ו/8` a
          PROVIDED a AT LEAST `clothing allowance of circular תשפ"ו/8` `position fraction with this employer`
    WITHIN `month number` July
    LEST BREACH BY `the employer` BECAUSE "תשפ\"ו/8 §1.א: the clothing allowance is paid in full with July 2026's salary"

-- 1.ו: 140% across all employers for a teaching employee, 150% for a
-- principal outside the reform; 131.5% in full Oz LaTmura and 117% in Ofek
-- Hadash, subject to the exceptional-employment procedure for תשפ"ו. The
-- 140% is read, as the closing paragraph of 1 states it, as the limit
-- "without the reform", and each named group's own limit governs it
-- (F-2025-26_tashpo_08-c).
-- akn:art_1__para_f akn:art_1__para_f/p2 `the position limit across all employers` is declared once, in clothing-recuperation-circulars-common, which this file imports.

-- F-2025-26_tashpo_08-c: 1.ו puts the 140% limit on every teaching
-- employee, and a principal outside the reform is one; the same paragraph
-- gives that principal 150%.
-- `1.ו's limit for every teaching employee` is declared once, in clothing-recuperation-circulars-common, which this file imports.

#ASSERT `1.ו gives a principal outside the reform two limits`

-- akn:art_1__para_f/p4 The address of the exceptional-employment procedure; the procedure itself is not in the corpus.

-- The closing paragraph of 1: nothing above changes the conditions for
-- approval of these positions or permits employment beyond them.
@ref akn:art_1/p5 akn:art_1__para_f/p3
GIVEN t IS AN `employment track`, `approved under the exceptional-employment procedure` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A DEONTIC Party `tashpo-8 clothing action`
DECIDE `no employment beyond the limits of circular תשפ"ו/8` t `approved under the exceptional-employment procedure` IS
    IF `approved under the exceptional-employment procedure`
    THEN FULFILLED
    ELSE PARTY `the employer`
         SHANT `employ beyond the limits in circular תשפ"ו/8` p
               PROVIDED p GREATER THAN `the position limit across all employers` t
         LEST BREACH BY `the employer` BECAUSE "תשפ\"ו/8 §1: no permit to employ beyond the position limits"

§§ `2 קצובת ביגוד נוספת למורה לחינוך גופני`

GIVEN r IS A NUMBER, b IS A `rate band`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `the rate falls in circular תשפ"ו/8 in` r b IF
        (    (b's `band from inclusive` AND r AT LEAST b's `band above`)
          OR ((NOT b's `band from inclusive`) AND r GREATER THAN b's `band above`))
    AND (    (b's `band to inclusive` AND r AT MOST b's `band up to`)
          OR ((NOT b's `band to inclusive`) AND r LESS THAN b's `band up to`))

GIVEN r IS A NUMBER, table IS A LIST OF `rate band`
GIVETH A LIST OF NUMBER
DECIDE `the amounts the table gives of circular תשפ"ו/8 for` r table IS
    map (GIVEN b YIELD b's `band amount`) (filter (GIVEN b YIELD `the rate falls in circular תשפ"ו/8 in` r b) table)

GIVEN table IS A LIST OF `rate band`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `every rate has exactly one row in circular תשפ"ו/8 in` table IF
    all (GIVEN r YIELD count (`the amounts the table gives of circular תשפ"ו/8 for` r table) EQUALS 1)
        (LIST 0, 0.1, 0.29, 0.2999, 0.3, 0.31, 0.45, 0.5, 0.5001, 0.51, 0.75, 1)

-- "עד 30% לא כולל" · "מ-30% ועד 50% כולל" · "מעל 50%", as at 1.9.2026
-- (F-2025-26_tashpo_08-b: a date after the school year the allowance is for),
-- updating the amounts of circular תשע"ב/8 (not restated here).
@ref akn:art_2/p2 akn:art_2/t1
`the physical-education table of circular תשפ"ו/8` MEANS
    LIST `rate band` 0   TRUE  0.3 FALSE 0,
         `rate band` 0.3 TRUE  0.5 TRUE  806.07,
         `rate band` 0.5 FALSE 999 TRUE  1607.93

#ASSERT `every rate has exactly one row in circular תשפ"ו/8 in` `the physical-education table of circular תשפ"ו/8`

-- F-2025-26_tashpo_08-b: both part-time tables print their amounts as
-- correct for 1/9/2026, the first day of the school year AFTER the one the
-- allowances are for (09/25–08/26), and after July 2026, when §1 and §4 are
-- paid. Months counted as year × 12 + month. The reading adopted: the
-- printed amounts are paid for תשפ"ו as they stand.
`the tables' date` MEANS 2026 TIMES 12 PLUS 9
`the last month of school year תשפ"ו` MEANS 2026 TIMES 12 PLUS 8
`the tables' amounts are dated after the school year they are paid for` MEANS
    `the tables' date` GREATER THAN `the last month of school year תשפ"ו`
#ASSERT `the tables' amounts are dated after the school year they are paid for`

GIVEN `employment rate` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `physical-education allowance of circular תשפ"ו/8` `employment rate` IS
    sum (`the amounts the table gives of circular תשפ"ו/8 for` `employment rate` `the physical-education table of circular תשפ"ו/8`)

-- 2, first paragraph: in addition to the general clothing allowance, and
-- it covers sun-protection products. The circular sets no month for it,
-- so the duty carries no deadline.
@ref akn:art_2/p1
GIVEN `employment rate` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A DEONTIC Party `tashpo-8 clothing action`
DECIDE `physical-education allowance paid of circular תשפ"ו/8` `employment rate` IS
    PARTY `the employer`
    MUST  `pay the physical-education allowance in circular תשפ"ו/8` a
          PROVIDED a AT LEAST `physical-education allowance of circular תשפ"ו/8` `employment rate`
    LEST BREACH BY `the employer` BECAUSE "תשפ\"ו/8 §2: the physical-education teacher's additional clothing allowance for תשפ\"ו"

§§ `3 קצובת ביגוד בחינוך הטכנולוגי`

-- 3, first paragraph: the technological-education teacher or professional
-- instructor is paid a clothing allowance for school year תשפ"ו by the list
-- of professions below. As for §2, the circular sets no month for it.
@ref akn:art_3/p1
GIVEN `profession` IS A STRING, `position fraction in technological education` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A DEONTIC Party `tashpo-8 clothing action`
DECIDE `technological-education allowance paid of circular תשפ"ו/8` `profession` `position fraction in technological education` IS
    PARTY `the employer`
    MUST  `pay the technological-education allowance in circular תשפ"ו/8` a
          PROVIDED a AT LEAST `technological-education allowance of circular תשפ"ו/8` `profession` `position fraction in technological education`
    LEST BREACH BY `the employer` BECAUSE "תשפ\"ו/8 §3: the technological-education clothing allowance for תשפ\"ו"

-- 3.1א's table: a pair of shoes and two robes a year.
-- akn:art_3__para_3-1__subpara_a akn:art_3__para_3-1__subpara_a/t1 `the professions with shoes and two robes` is declared once, in clothing-recuperation-circulars-common, which this file imports.

@ref akn:art_3__para_3-1__subpara_a/p2
`the value of a pair of shoes and two robes of circular תשפ"ו/8` MEANS 663.14

-- 3.1ב's table: two robes a year.
-- akn:art_3__para_3-1__subpara_b akn:art_3__para_3-1__subpara_b/t1 `the professions with two robes` is declared once, in clothing-recuperation-circulars-common, which this file imports.

@ref akn:art_3__para_3-1__subpara_b/p2
`the value of two robes of circular תשפ"ו/8` MEANS 411.97

-- 3.2: in addition to the general clothing allowance. 3.3: in proportion
-- to the position in technological education, one full position at most.
@ref akn:art_3__para_3-2 akn:art_3__para_3-3
GIVEN `profession` IS A STRING, `position fraction in technological education` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `technological-education allowance of circular תשפ"ו/8` `profession` `position fraction in technological education` IS
    (IF elem `profession` `the professions with shoes and two robes`
     THEN `the value of a pair of shoes and two robes of circular תשפ"ו/8`
     ELSE IF elem `profession` `the professions with two robes`
          THEN `the value of two robes of circular תשפ"ו/8`
          ELSE 0)
    TIMES min `position fraction in technological education` 1

§§ `4 קצובת ביגוד לפיזיותרפיסטים`

@ref akn:art_4/p1
GIVEN `teaching employee in the health professions` IS A BOOLEAN
      `holds a physiotherapy certificate` IS A BOOLEAN
      `treats by physiotherapy in the teaching role` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `is a physiotherapist in circular תשפ"ו/8` `teaching employee in the health professions` `holds a physiotherapy certificate` `treats by physiotherapy in the teaching role` IF
        `teaching employee in the health professions`
    AND `holds a physiotherapy certificate`
    AND `treats by physiotherapy in the teaching role`

-- 4, second paragraph: a full-time physiotherapist in Ofek Hadash or Oz
-- LaTmura: 800 "only", once a year with July's salary, in addition to the
-- clothing allowance (citing תשפ"ג/4 §14 and תשפ"ה/5 §15, not restated here).
-- akn:art_4/p2 `the full-time physiotherapists' allowance` is declared once, in clothing-recuperation-circulars-common, which this file imports.

-- Paid once a year, with July's salary.
GIVEN `position fraction` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A DEONTIC Party `tashpo-8 clothing action`
DECIDE `physiotherapists' allowance paid with July's salary of circular תשפ"ו/8` `position fraction` IS
    PARTY `the employer`
    MUST  `pay the physiotherapists' allowance in circular תשפ"ו/8` a
          PROVIDED a AT LEAST `physiotherapists' allowance of circular תשפ"ו/8` `position fraction`
    WITHIN `month number` July
    LEST BREACH BY `the employer` BECAUSE "תשפ\"ו/8 §4: the physiotherapists' clothing allowance is paid with July's salary"

-- 4, third paragraph and its table: part-time, by the rules of the
-- physical-education allowance, as at 1.9.2026 (F-2025-26_tashpo_08-b).
@ref akn:art_4/p3 akn:art_4/t1
`the physiotherapists' part-time table of circular תשפ"ו/8` MEANS
    LIST `rate band` 0   TRUE  0.3 FALSE 0,
         `rate band` 0.3 TRUE  0.5 TRUE  432.06,
         `rate band` 0.5 FALSE 999 TRUE  864.12

#ASSERT `every rate has exactly one row in circular תשפ"ו/8 in` `the physiotherapists' part-time table of circular תשפ"ו/8`

-- F-2025-26_tashpo_08-a: the table's top row ("מעל 50%") pays 864.12,
-- more than the full-time 800, and a full position is itself "above 50%".
`the part-time table pays more than the full-time allowance above 50% in circular תשפ"ו/8` MEANS
    `the amounts the table gives of circular תשפ"ו/8 for` 0.6 `the physiotherapists' part-time table of circular תשפ"ו/8`
        EQUALS LIST 864.12
    AND 864.12 GREATER THAN `the full-time physiotherapists' allowance`
    AND `the amounts the table gives of circular תשפ"ו/8 for` 1 `the physiotherapists' part-time table of circular תשפ"ו/8`
        EQUALS LIST 864.12
#ASSERT `the part-time table pays more than the full-time allowance above 50% in circular תשפ"ו/8`

-- The reading adopted (F-2025-26_tashpo_08-a): a full position is paid by
-- the second paragraph (800), and the table governs part-time positions.
@export The additional clothing allowance for a physiotherapist in Ofek Hadash or Oz LaTmura for school year תשפ"ו under circular תשפ"ו/8
GIVEN `position fraction` IS A NUMBER @desc the physiotherapist's position (1 = a full position)
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `physiotherapists' allowance of circular תשפ"ו/8` `position fraction` IS
    IF `position fraction` AT LEAST 1
    THEN `the full-time physiotherapists' allowance`
    ELSE sum (`the amounts the table gives of circular תשפ"ו/8 for` `position fraction` `the physiotherapists' part-time table of circular תשפ"ו/8`)

-- akn:conclusions The contact line, signatures and copies; no rule.

§§ `Worked examples`

-- The two lists are disjoint, thirteen professions each, so no profession
-- is given two allowances.
#ASSERT all (GIVEN p YIELD NOT elem p `the professions with two robes`) `the professions with shoes and two robes`
#ASSERT count `the professions with shoes and two robes` EQUALS 13 AND count `the professions with two robes` EQUALS 13

-- Examples (positions and professions are placeholders; amounts are the circular's).
#ASSERT `clothing allowance of circular תשפ"ו/8` 0.5 EQUALS 1263.5
#ASSERT `clothing allowance of circular תשפ"ו/8` 1.3 EQUALS 2527
#ASSERT `physical-education allowance of circular תשפ"ו/8` 0.29 EQUALS 0
#ASSERT `physical-education allowance of circular תשפ"ו/8` 0.3 EQUALS 806.07
#ASSERT `physical-education allowance of circular תשפ"ו/8` 0.5 EQUALS 806.07
#ASSERT `physical-education allowance of circular תשפ"ו/8` 0.51 EQUALS 1607.93
#ASSERT `technological-education allowance of circular תשפ"ו/8` "מכטרוניקה" 1 EQUALS 663.14
#ASSERT `technological-education allowance of circular תשפ"ו/8` "סיעוד" 0.5 EQUALS 205.985
#ASSERT `physiotherapists' allowance of circular תשפ"ו/8` 1 EQUALS 800
#ASSERT `physiotherapists' allowance of circular תשפ"ו/8` 0.4 EQUALS 432.06

#TRACE `clothing allowance paid in full with July's salary of circular תשפ"ו/8` 1 AT 0 WITH
    PARTY `the employer` DOES `pay the clothing allowance in circular תשפ"ו/8` 2527 AT 11
#TRACE `physiotherapists' allowance paid with July's salary of circular תשפ"ו/8` 1 AT 0 WITH
    PARTY `the employer` DOES `pay the physiotherapists' allowance in circular תשפ"ו/8` 800 AT 11
#TRACE `no employment beyond the limits of circular תשפ"ו/8` `a teacher in Ofek Hadash` FALSE AT 0 WITH
    PARTY `the employer` DOES `employ beyond the limits in circular תשפ"ו/8` 1.2 AT 2

-- F-2025-26_tashpo_08-d: §1ד pays by the position "and not more than one full
-- position"; §1ה pays an employee of several employers, whose total is
-- above 100%, each employer's own share. Reading adopted, as in
-- F-2018-19_tashat_08-b: §1ה governs several employers, and §1ד's cap is
-- at each employer, as the allowance above is encoded.
-- `the employer shares the multi-employer rule gives for 80% and 60%` is declared once, in clothing-recuperation-circulars-2-common, which this file imports.
#ASSERT `the one-position cap and the multi-employer rule disagree for two employers`

-- F-2025-26_tashpo_08-e: the table bands "שיעור העסקה" without saying whether a teacher
-- with more than one employer is banded per employer or across them; per
-- employer, two at 40% each pay more than one at 80%. The reading adopted,
-- as F-2021-22_tashpab_07-b's: each employer applies the table to the
-- position it employs.
`two employers at 40% each pay more than one employer at 80% in circular תשפ"ו/8` MEANS
    `physical-education allowance of circular תשפ"ו/8` 0.4 PLUS `physical-education allowance of circular תשפ"ו/8` 0.4
        GREATER THAN `physical-education allowance of circular תשפ"ו/8` 0.8
#ASSERT `two employers at 40% each pay more than one employer at 80% in circular תשפ"ו/8`

§§ `Property checks`

-- The circular over finite spaces: covered or not; positions and rates in
-- hundredths from 0 to 1.5; every profession on either list and one on
-- neither; every terms; the three physiotherapist conditions.

`every terms of circular תשפ"ו/8` MEANS LIST `a teacher outside the reforms`, `a principal outside the reforms`, `a teacher in Oz LaTmura in full implementation`, `a teacher in Ofek Hadash`
`every profession checked of circular תשפ"ו/8` MEANS append `the professions with shoes and two robes` (append `the professions with two robes` (LIST "מקצוע אחר"))

-- §1 over coverage and position: covered exactly on both conditions; the
-- allowance is level 4's ₪2,527 pro rata to the position up to one, never
-- falling with a larger position. Every limit allows a full position and
-- the principal's 150% is the highest (finding).
#ASSERT all (GIVEN g YIELD
                all (GIVEN o YIELD `is entitled to the public-facing clothing allowance for school year תשפ"ו` g o EQUALS (g AND o)) `both booleans`)
            `both booleans`
#ASSERT all (GIVEN f YIELD
                    `clothing allowance of circular תשפ"ו/8` f EQUALS 2527 TIMES min f 1
                AND `clothing allowance of circular תשפ"ו/8` f AT MOST `clothing allowance of circular תשפ"ו/8` (f PLUS 0.01))
            `hundredths to 1.5`
#ASSERT all (GIVEN t YIELD
                    `the position limit across all employers` t AT LEAST 1
                AND `the position limit across all employers` t AT MOST `the position limit across all employers` `a principal outside the reforms`)
            `every terms of circular תשפ"ו/8`

-- §2 over every rate: exactly one band; nothing below 30%, ₪806.07 to a
-- half, ₪1,607.93 above it; never falling with a larger rate.
#ASSERT all (GIVEN r YIELD
                    count (`the amounts the table gives of circular תשפ"ו/8 for` r `the physical-education table of circular תשפ"ו/8`) EQUALS 1
                AND `physical-education allowance of circular תשפ"ו/8` r EQUALS (IF r LESS THAN 0.3 THEN 0 ELSE IF r AT MOST 0.5 THEN 806.07 ELSE 1607.93)
                AND `physical-education allowance of circular תשפ"ו/8` r AT MOST `physical-education allowance of circular תשפ"ו/8` (r PLUS 0.01))
            `hundredths to 1.5`

-- §3 over every profession and position: the item of its list (₪663.14 or
-- ₪411.97, nothing off both), pro rata to the position up to one; never
-- above ₪663.14.
#ASSERT all (GIVEN p YIELD
                all (GIVEN f YIELD
                        LET a MEANS `technological-education allowance of circular תשפ"ו/8` p f
                        IN      a EQUALS `technological-education allowance of circular תשפ"ו/8` p 1 TIMES min f 1
                            AND elem (`technological-education allowance of circular תשפ"ו/8` p 1) (LIST 0, 411.97, 663.14)
                            AND a AT MOST 663.14)
                    (map (GIVEN k YIELD k DIVIDED BY 10) (range 0 15)))
            `every profession checked of circular תשפ"ו/8`

-- §4 over the three conditions and every position: a physiotherapist
-- exactly on all three; the allowance from the part-time table below a full
-- position and ₪800 from it, never falling with a larger position but at a
-- full position, where the table's ₪864.12 gives way to ₪800 (finding).
#ASSERT all (GIVEN a YIELD
                all (GIVEN b YIELD
                        all (GIVEN c YIELD `is a physiotherapist in circular תשפ"ו/8` a b c EQUALS (a AND b AND c)) `both booleans`)
                    `both booleans`)
            `both booleans`
#ASSERT all (GIVEN f YIELD
                    count (`the amounts the table gives of circular תשפ"ו/8 for` f `the physiotherapists' part-time table of circular תשפ"ו/8`) EQUALS 1
                AND (f EQUALS 0.99 OR `physiotherapists' allowance of circular תשפ"ו/8` f AT MOST `physiotherapists' allowance of circular תשפ"ו/8` (f PLUS 0.01))
                AND `physiotherapists' allowance of circular תשפ"ו/8` f AT MOST 864.12)
            `hundredths to 1.5`
